# Shareable documents for {{project_name}}

The stand-in links only rows whose Status is `shared`, whose Audience is
in the policy's `link_audiences`, and whose Verified date is within the
policy's `link_verify_max_age_days`. Seeded at init from the links the
allowed wiki pages cite; `/compathy-respond verify` fills Status, Verified
and Via from the connectors (Drive permissions, Notion's Private section,
kind rules). Set Via to `manual` on a row you decide yourself; `verify`
never overwrites a manual row.

Kind: gdoc, gsheet, gslides, claude-artifact, claude-design, linear,
notion, storybook, figma, sharepoint, public (a .gov or .edu site), other
(an unknown host; never auto-shared). Audience: internal, all, or a team name.
Status: shared, private, unknown. Verified: the date of the last check.
Via: how it was decided (drive:domain, drive:anyone, drive:users,
notion:private-section, notion:not-private, rule:<kind>, manual).

